      "writtenOn": "2025-03-03T18:17:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because there is a property which sets the minimum duration for a clip to be offloaded, this is the code in APM which checks it:\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/av/services/audiopolicy/managerdefault/AudioPolicyManager.cpp;l\u003d4830;drc\u003dbd205f23c74d7498c9958d2bfa8622aacfe59517\n\nSo if we want offload not to be rejected based on that, we need to set a rather long duration, this is what the system code actually does:\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/core/jni/android_media_AudioSystem.cpp;l\u003d2546;drc\u003d3d1050f4d0b79b3824f8b3c4a7bb97b2ad6a32dc\n\nIt would arguably be better if we actually read the value of the property instead of using hardcoded 2 minutes, but I think that should be done in all places not just in this test, for consistency.",
      "parentUuid": "d20254d2_0cbfd099",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 190,
        "startChar": 42,
        "endLine": 190,
        "endChar": 81
      },
